.SS listtemplates
.TP
.IP
List available hard disk templates.
This command does not accept any options.
.SS Compression algorithms
The following compression algorithms are supported:
.PP
.B zlib \(en zlib deflate
.IP
.IP
Compresses data using the zlib deflate algorithm.
.IP
.PP
.B zstd \(en Zstandard
.IP
.IP
Compresses data using the Zstandard algorithm. 
This gives very good compression and decompression performance with 
better compression ratios than zlib deflate, but older software may 
not support CHD files that use Zstandard compression.
.IP
.PP
.B lzma \(en Lempel\-Ziv\-Markov chain algorithm
.IP
.IP
Compresses data using the Lempel\-Ziv\-Markov\-chain algorithm (LZMA). 
This gives high compression ratios at the cost of poor compression and 
decompression performance.
.IP
.PP
.B huff \(en Huffman coding
.IP
.IP
Compresses data using 8\-bit Huffman entropy coding.
.IP
.PP
.B flac \(en Free Lossless Audio Codec
.IP
.IP
Compresses data as two\-channel (stereo) 16\-bit 44.1 kHz PCM audio 
using the Free Lossless Audio Codec (FLAC). This gives good 
compression ratios if the media contains 16\-bit PCM audio data.
.IP
.PP
.B cdzl \(en zlib deflate for CD\-ROM data
.IP
.IP
Compresses audio data and subchannel data from CD\-ROM sectors 
separately using the zlib deflate algorithm.
.IP
.PP
.B cdzs \(en Zstandard for CD\-ROM data
.IP
.IP
Compresses audio data and subchannel data from CD\-ROM sectors 
separately using the Zstandard algorithm. This gives very good 
compression and decompression performance with better 
compression ratios than zlib deflate, but older software may 
not support CHD files that use Zstandard compression.
.IP
.PP
.B cdlz \- Lempel\-Ziv\-Markov chain algorithm/zlib deflate for CD\-ROM data
.IP
.IP
Compresses audio data and subchannel data from CD\-ROM sectors 
separately using the Lempel\-Ziv\-Markov chain algorithm (LZMA) for 
audio data and the zlib deflate algorithm for subchannel data. 
This gives high compression ratios at the cost of poor compression and 
decompression performance.
.IP
.PP
.B cdfl \(en Free Lossless Audio Codec/zlib deflate for CD\-ROM data
.IP
.IP
Compresses audio data and subchannel data from CD\-ROM sectors 
separately using the Free Lossless Audio Codec (FLAC) for 
audio data and the zlib deflate algorithm for subchannel data. 
This gives good compression ratios for audio CD tracks.
.IP
.PP
.B avhu \(en Huffman coding for audio\-visual data
.IP
.IP
This is a specialised compression algorithm for 
audio\-visual (A/V) data. It should only be used for 
LaserDisc CHD files.
.IP
